1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Find a Grave:   Firstborn son of Stephan A. Olsen Ahola and Ida Marie Abrahamsdatter Luusua. Johan's father dropped the surname of Ahola, shortly after coming to the US and used the Americanized spelling for Olson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan's death was the first Ahola/Olson family tragedy, here in the US, that the family was to suffer. He was only 16 years old, and while exiting a boat, his gun accidentally went off, killing him. 
