1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Anton født 1877 i Bugøynes, døpt både i Vadsø bysogn 1878 og i Sør-Varanger prestegjeld 1878
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/104197444/thomas-anton-luusua
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Thomas Anton Luusua, 1877 - 1960
2 CONT Thomas Anton Luusua was born on 1877 to Thomas Luusua and Kaisa Maria Luusua (born Ahola).
2 CONT Thomas was born on August 12 1854, in Sodankylä, Finland.
2 CONT Kaisa was born in 1858, in Finland.
2 CONT Thomas had 7 siblings: Millie Mathilda Amanda Wilcox (born Luusua), Tilda Karoliina Luusua and 5 other siblings.
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas married Maria Gustava Luusua (born Kurtti) .
2 CONT Maria was born in 1883, in Minnesota, USA.
2 CONT Thomas passed away on 1960, at age 82 in Michigan.
2 CONT He was buried in Michigan.''
