1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hulda Sofia Mäkelä, born 1889, from Ylikiiminki parish got passport no.1980 for America on 12 Nov 1907.
2 CONT
2 CONT N.B. There was no "Hulda Sofia" born in Ylikiiminki in 1889 but there was this Hilda Sofia Mäkelä.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hilda Mäkelä departed from Hanko aboard SS Astraea on 16 Nov 1907. Atlantic crossing from Southampton aboard SS Victorian of the Allan Line on 22 Nov 1997. Destination Ishpeming, Marquette, Michigan.
2 CONT
2 CONT ”Hilta Makalo” born 1889 Finland, residence Marquette, Michigan married to ”Jakki Harja” in Chatham, Alger, MI on 18 Dec 1908: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:N3V4-6RJ
2 CONT
2 CONT US Census 1910: ”Hilda Hill” & ”Jacob Hill” in Forsyth, Marquette, Michigan https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:MLR4-DLY
