1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ylikiiminki parish births: http://digi.narc.fi/digi/view.ka?kuid=4947186
2 CONT
2 CONT "Admitterad" 1870 (= Confirmation ceremony at church; allowed to participate communion and allowed to marry).
2 CONT
2 CONT Farm hand in Ylikiiminki Communion Book 1869-1879 page 109 no.4 Karjalainen: https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=18061&pnum=109
2 CONT
2 CONT With his first wife Maria and second wife Anna in Ylikiiminki Communion Book 1869-1879 page 201 "W": https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=18061&pnum=200
2 CONT
2 CONT Married in 1876 but got widowed the same year already. Remarried 1879.
2 CONT
2 CONT With his second wife Anna in Ylikiiminki Communion Book 1880-1890 page 188 "W": https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=18062&pnum=178
2 CONT
2 CONT They had daughter Liisa on 18 Apr 1884.
2 CONT
2 CONT The communion book indicates that Carl Henrik had gone to America in 1887.
2 CONT Absent in Ylikiiminki Communion Book 1891-1900 page 230 "W": https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=18063&pnum=225
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT His wife Anna Soronen got an illegitimate child in Ylikiiminki on 7 Apr 1890, and another on 29 Dec 1893.
2 CONT Ylikiiminki Children's Book 1891-1900 page 200: https://www.sukuhistoria.fi/sshy/sivut/jasenille/paikat.php?bid=18617&pnum=184
2 CONT
2 CONT We don't know what happened to his wife Anna in Finland. We can see that Carl (Charles Wilks) had remarried in America prior to 1910.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1910 Census, 77 Water st. Centennial Mine location, Calumet, Houghton Michigan, USA-  <br/>
2 CONT Charles Wilks, Age 56,Married, Born in Finland, Immigrated 1887, naturalized, Speaks Finnish , Occupation Miner, Employment - Copper mine. <br/>
2 CONT Wife Amanda, Age 56, Married, Born in Finland,  Immigrated 1880, Speaks Finnish, Employment None. <br/>
2 CONT Stepson John, Age 23, Single, Born in Michigan, Speaks english, Miner, Employed at copper mine. <br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT "United States Census, 1910," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:33S7-9RJ1-S4L?cc=1727033&wc=QZZ7-G9Z%3A133637101%2C138755601%2C134852602%2C1589089199 : 24 June 2017), Michigan > Houghton >
2 CONC  Calumet > ED 107 > image 52 of 66; citing NARA microfilm publication T624 (Washington, D.C.: National Archives and Records Administration, n.d.).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT MADE SURE OF CERTAIN DEATH<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT C. WIRKKUNEN A MINER, LAYS ACROSS TWO STICKS OF DYNAMITE AND LIGHTS A FUSE.<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Chas. Wirrkunen, a miner, committed suicide in a horrible manner in No. 6 Shaft, North Kearsarge branch of the Osceola Consolidated, last night, when he laid on two sticks of dynamite, lighted a fuse and awaited certain death. His
2 CONC  head was blown off and the upper part of the trunk badly shattered.<br/>
2 CONT Wirkkunen, who was aged 55, is survived by his wife and a family of grown-up children. The accident happened about 10 o'clock. That suicide was premeditated, is vouched for by fellow miners, who testified at the inquest this morni
2 CONC ng that they heard him state he was going to do away with himself. It is surmised the decedent was in a despondent frame of mind. <br/>
2 CONT Coroner William Fisher was notified of the accident late last night, and this morning held an inquest, a verdict being returned in accordance with the evidence.<br/>
2 CONT Wirkkunen was an old and respected resident of Calumet, and the news of his act being received with general regret. 
2 CONT
2 CONT News, T. et al. (2021) Chas Wirkkunen - Newspapers.com, Newspapers.com. Available at: https://www.newspapers.com/clip/74539162/chas-wirkkunen/ (Accessed: 3 September 2021).
2 CONT
2 CONT The funeral of the late Charles Wirkkunen, also known as Charles Wilks who committed suicide in North Kearsarge mine last week, took place Saturday afternoon with interment in Lake View cemetery. 
2 CONT
2 CONT News, T. et al. (2021) Clipping from The Calumet News - Newspapers.com, Newspapers.com. Available at: https://www.newspapers.com/clip/79066825/the-calumet-news/ (Accessed: 3 September 2021).
2 CONT
2 CONT ...In the Matter of the Estate of Charles Wirkkula, Deceased. Greeta Amanda Wirkkula, widow of deceased, having filed in said court her petition praying that the administration of said estate be granted to John R. Bennetts or to s
2 CONC ome suitable person.. Etc
2 CONT
2 CONT News, T. et al. (2021) Clipping from The Calumet News - Newspapers.com, Newspapers.com. Available at: https://www.newspapers.com/clip/83661704/the-calumet-news/ (Accessed: 3 September 2021).
