1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He was born Rafel Rasmussen Strand, baptized 23 Jul 1893. He came to the states somewhere 1911-1914. His WWI draft registration says he was a merchant seaman at that time and lived in Brooklyn, New York. Later, he 
2 CONC married and lived in Seattle. His mother was Beret Anna Mortinusdatter and father, Rasmus Andreasen Toften Strand.
