2 CONT Mrs. Komula was born March 17, 1916 in Trimountain, Mich. to Waino and Lena (Johnson) Virenius. She had been a Yolo County resident for two years. She attended area schools in Michigan and was a homemaker for more than 72 years.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include Mrs. Komula's daughter, Mona Thomas and husband John, son, Ron Komula and wife Linda, all of Woodland, sister, Violet Hoge of Pasco, Wash., grandsons, Jaysen Thomas of Yuba City, Erik and Ryan Komula of Woodland,
2 CONC  as well as numerous nieces and nephews. She was preceded in death by her husband, Eino Komula, brothers, Walter and Eino Virenius, and grandson, Kevin Thomas.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
