1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Leonard (aka Lank) was born in Calumet, Houghton County, Michigan, the son of Saulus (Ahvenlampi) Lampi and Maria Mathilda (Mary) Simula, both born in Finland. He was the brother to Martha, Effie, Saulus, Carl, Mil
2 CONC dred, Helen, Oscar, Laila, Ruben, John and Irvin. He was the grandson of Lisa Caisadatter Ahvenlampi of Pyhajoki, Oulu, Finland (aka Mrs Lisa Lampi in the US). He was also the grandson of Staffan/Tapani Simula and Kaisa Lisa Ranta
2 CONC halvari Simula, of Sodaykyla, Lappi, Finland. They were known as Stephan and Kate Simula in the US.
