1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Wallace Teto Sr. was born in Fitchburg, Worcester County, Massachusetts in 1923, the son of Gladys Annie Teto and an unknown father. Subsequent Y-DNA testing has uncovered the high possibility that his birth father
2 CONC  was Harry Don Kanfer (1885-1942). After his birth he was raised by his grandparents, Matthew Teto and Dora (Olson) Teto before marrying Ellen M (Taylor) Teto on October 12, 1946.
2 CONT
2 CONT He is survived by 3 children, 2 grandchildren, and 3 great-grandchildren.
