1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Michigan,1930 federal census, Population schedules: Houghton County, Chassell township: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:33S7-9R46-6DL?i=14&cc=1810731&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AXQ1M-1ZG
2 CONT
2 CONT * Michigan,1940 federal census, Population schedules: Houghton County, Chassell township: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3QS7-89M1-J9DW?i=21&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AK4LH-4PV
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/110306899/henry-kivari
2 CONT
2 CONT "Henry Kivari, 91, a resident of Lehtola Rd., Chassell, passed away Monday morning April 23, 2007, at Portage Pointe in Hancock were he had been a resident patient for the past 3 months.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born on February 8, 1916, in Chassell a son of the late John and Kaisa Sofia (Isoviita) Kivari. As a child he attended the Chassell School.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry was a veteran having served with the United States Army during World War II.
2 CONT
2 CONT On March 19, 1949, he was united in marriage to Alice Luusua.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Kivari had moved to Detroit and worked as a Tool & Die maker for Detroit Reamer & Tool Company. In 1983 Henry retired and moved back home to Chassell where he has resided since.
2 CONT
2 CONT Henry was a member of the Old Apostolic Lutheran Church of Hancock.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceding him in death were his parents 4 brothers Louis, John, Paul, Ralph, and a sister Martha Tuomi.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are:
2 CONT His wife Alice Kivari of Chassell
2 CONT Children: Warren (Tarja) Kivari of Chassell
2 CONT Rachel (Daniel) Pedersen of South Haven, MN
2 CONT Norman (Carol) Kivari of Blaine, MN
2 CONT Andrew (Jana) Kivari of Walled Lake, MI
2 CONT 32 Grandchildren, 13 Great Grandchildren
2 CONT
2 CONT Sisters: Sigrid Lund of Lower Michigan
2 CONT Helmi Hongisto of Clawson, MI
2 CONT Ruth Landen of Chassell, MI
2 CONT
2 CONT Numerous nieces, nephews, cousins, & a host of christian friends."
