0 @N6000000003917774565@ NOTE John was a very nimble person.  Played baseball in early days as a catcher with only a piece of hide as a catcher's mitt.
1 CONT
1 CONT His grandchildren begged him for a foot race.  He said that he would not race them until he was 80 years old.  The kids did not let him forget that promise.  The day finally came for the race.  The kids did not win!!!!
1 CONT
1 CONT In 1948-9 when they visited, Arnold was tossing a baseball against the log haybarn.  John almost 80 years old picked up a bat and hit many pitches.  Arnold often got 2 strikes on him but could NEVER strike him out.  Slim and Eva w
1 CONC ere here also that day.
1 CONT
1 CONT John and Kristina cared for Kaisa Stina in her last days in Mohawk.
1 CONT Then they cared for Kaisa Liisa in her last days at Keweenaw Bay.
1 CONT Kaisa Liisa is said to have been a difficult person in her last days.
