0 @N6000000003917774485@ NOTE # 14.
1 CONT After wedding, lived 10 years or so on Kinnunen farm.
1 CONT Beans and Pat bought John Simula's farm together and later split the farm.  Beans took the Luuko side and Pat the Simula side.  Each was 20 acres wide and a mile long.
